# Half-Life H3 exit (run.sh play), one Loop A --keys item per line: seconds,
# then the set 1 scancode (0x1xx are E0 keys). Each @TEXT line waits for
# TEXT on COM1 and times the lines after it from there, so the script keeps
# its order however slowly 86Box runs. HL-ACTIVE <map> is the engine's line
# for "the client is in the level": before it (loading, reconnecting after a
# level change) the console key and game keys are ignored.
@Localize_AddToDict          # mainui is up: the main menu
8.0:0x31                     # N: New game
15.0:0x32                    # M: Medium
@HL-ACTIVE c0a0              # the new game is running
5.0:0x40                     # F6: quick save (WON's default.cfg)
@Saving game to save/quick.sav
5.0:0x41                     # F7: quick load
@HL-ACTIVE c0a0a             # the tram took the player through the landmark
5.0:0x29                     # ` console
5.6:0x10                     # q
6.2:0x16                     # u
6.8:0x17                     # i
7.4:0x14                     # t
8.0:0x1c                     # Enter
